From e73677e9fca8f5ec82d930456da506365301728b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 07:07:50 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix(agent): withhold rejected final output until final
 transforms (F3 core companion) (#105)

* fix(agent): withhold rejected final output across delivery boundaries [daveey]

* [daveey] Keep buffered final replies private through output transforms

* feat(hooks): advertise buffered final-publication contract [daveey]

* Keep buffered verification candidates private until final transforms

* fix(agent): satisfy code-health ratchet for final-gate release path

* docs(pre-final-gate): note hold=True is bounded by the attempt budget [daveey]

---------

Co-authored-by: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
